sample_frames.py: Takes videos from data/dr_videos and samples 7 frames to data/informative_frames/frames_raw_extract

grade_frames.py: Take frames from data/frames_raw_extract and grade into 2 classes using an interface.

crop_frames.py: Use the 5 trained cropping models to crop the extracted frames and move them to 0 and 1 folders

classify_frames.py: Use images in data/informative_frames/frames_cropped to train 5 EfficientNets for classifying frames
into informative and not with 5 splits. Models are saved in models. split_info_5fold_{timestamp}.csv saves the
mapping

extract_inf_frames.py: Use trained cropping model ensemble and trained informative frames model ensemble to both crop
and filter all videos in a video folder;
results are saved in cleaned_videos and contains the clips and txts/plots that visualize the confidences for each frame